      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baldwin_Park%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1977 an F4 tornado struck Pleasant Hill and Baldwin Park, leaving a lasting mark on the community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://villageofbaldwinpark.weebly.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before 1945, Baldwin Park supplied food to nearby Pleasant Hill, acting as a local food hub.",
